  "body": "With many (including myself) moving away from Facebook products like Whatsapp (also ig, etc), it would be great to be able to import the entire message database from Whatsapp to Synapse.  Is this currently possible?\r\n\r\nI have both the Whatsapp bot installed and working however it seems that it's tightly integrated with Whatsapp Web and as such doesn't work when your phone with Whatsapp account is disconnected from the internet, much less Whatsapp removed all together.  The idea is to STOP USING WHATSAPP PERIOD.  Yet to be able to keep the history of messaging on the Whatsapp platform.\r\n\r\nApologies if this has already been addressed, I searched but didn't see anything...\r\n",
